  "page1": {
    "title": "Tales Grandmother Told",
    "subtitle": "An old Korean folktale about two brothers and a kind heart.",
    "body": "Last night, Grandmother told me a story. It was an old Korean tale. Long ago, two brothers lived in a village.\n\nThe older brother was rich, but he was mean. The younger brother was poor, but he had a kind heart. One day, the kind brother helped a hurt bird. He fixed its leg with care.\n\nThe bird flew back and gave him a magic seed. The seed grew into gourds full of gold. The poor brother became rich.\n\nThe greedy brother wanted gold too. So he broke a bird's leg on purpose. But his gourds were full of trouble.\n\nGrandmother smiled and said, \"<mark>Kindness comes back to you</mark>.\" A good <u>heart</u> brings good things. I will remember this tale forever.",
    "illustration": "assets/illustrations/mars/2026-07/05.jpg",
    "illustration_caption": "A grandmother telling two grandchildren the tale of the kind brother and the magic gourds."
  },
